        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill-rule="evenodd" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h12a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H9l-6 5V5Zm5 2.75a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5Zm4 0a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5Zm4 0a1.25 1.25 0 1 0 0 2.5 1.25 1.25 0 0 0 0-2.5Z"/></svg>
        <span><strong>Discussions</strong><span>Ask questions, share what you built, follow where this is going.</span></span>
